**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
# Incremental build state. Every emitting project keeps its .tsbuildinfo inside
# dist/ (enforced by scripts/build-packages.mjs), but apps/web is noEmit and has
# nowhere to put it — and a host's build state inside the image makes `tsc -b`
# skip projects whose dist/ was ignored, i.e. compile against types that were
# never emitted.
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.env
# React Native app is not part of the server image; the workspaces glob
# (apps/*) simply doesn't match it inside the build context.
apps/android
.env.*
!.env.example
# Local-only planning docs (both are gitignored, so CI's context never has them —
# without this line a local `docker build` format-checks files CI cannot see).
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
docs
data
# Dev-only symlink to the host data dir (/mnt/data/atlas).
backend/data
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-wal
